.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="For U an n \times n Haar-random unitary matrix (CUE) and its characteristic polynomial evaluated on the unit circle, Z_n(\theta) = \det(I - U e^{-i\theta}), the Diaconis-Shahshahani / Keating-Snaith formula gives the exact moments (positive integer k; by Haar-measure rotation invariance the value does not depend on \theta):">

